        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Ransom Riggs, John Berry\n- Works: Miss Peregrine's Home for Peculiar Children, Hollow City\n- Roles: writer, filmmaker, film director\n- Concepts: Hollywood blacklist\n- Places: France\n\nFacts:\n- John Berry was born on September 6, 1917.\n- Ransom Riggs was born on February 3, 1979.\n- John Berry was an American film director whose career was interrupted by the Hollywood blacklist.\n- John Berry went into self-exile in France.\n- Ransom Riggs is an American writer and filmmaker.\n- Ransom Riggs is best known for the book Miss Peregrine's Home for Peculiar Children.\n- Hollow City is a 2014 dark fantasy novel.\n- Hollow City is the sequel to Miss Peregrine's Home for Peculiar Children.\n- Ransom Riggs wrote Hollow City.\n- John Berry died on November 29, 1999.",
